The distributed jar contains only the code and assets of Just Replay. It bundles no
third-party library. The following software is used without being redistributed:

- Minecraft and NeoForge: the platform the mod runs on.
- FFmpeg (LGPL/GPL): an external program installed by the user, started as a separate
  process for video export. It is not linked to or shipped with the mod.
- Simple Voice Chat API (All Rights Reserved, Max Henkel): used at compile time only to
  build the optional voice chat integration; nothing of it is included in the jar.
- Optional integrations through public classes and APIs at runtime, nothing included:
  Distant Horizons, Emotecraft and playerAnimator, WaterFrames and WaterMedia, Create,
  Bobby, Iris, Sodium.
